# Mobilize 2 creates two Warrior tokens; with Elspeth, Storm Slayer's replacement (CR 614.1a) it creates four, and "sacrifice
# them at the beginning of the next end step" must sacrifice every token created, since the delayed triggered ability
# affects all the objects the effect created (CR 603.7c). Turn 3: the Voice attacks with four Warriors, and at the end step
# all four are sacrificed: only the Voice, Elspeth and the lands and artifacts remain.

